doc "aeh6jxizvyn35hrb5vyhtsswvn53sjurvjpq22wgvu2ytbshnel2etj" "Runs a domain spawning a task that connects to `port` and reads from the connection, while\nthe domain's body sleeps for 50 ms and then shares 100 among `items`; gives what the domain\nreturns."
